**Stack (Scenario 4)**: React 18 + TypeScript + **Vite** (frontend); **Node.js** +
**Express** + TypeScript + Zod (backend). Vitest in both packages. HTTP polling ~2s
(lobby + game + result); in-memory `roomStore` with viewer-filtered snapshots. No
WebSockets, DB, or auth. `playing`: drawer-only `secretWord`; `result`: word + final
scores + guess history for all; host `end-round` and `restart`; restart clears round
state and preserves roster.
